description: Vitest unit-test conventions
globs: ["src/**/*.test.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Colocated `*.test.ts`, node env, `server-only` aliased to no-op.
- Test every change in `actions/`, `services/`, `lib/`,
  `shopify/helpers.ts`. Do not unit-test `app/**` or `components/**`
  (typecheck + build cover those).
- Floors: branches 74, functions 68, lines/statements 35 — never lower.
- Smallest focused reproduction first: `yarn vitest run <path>`, then
  `yarn test:coverage`.
